# Loaded by `vite build --mode static`, which produces the build for a host that serves files and
# nothing else (GitHub Pages). There is no API process behind that site: the build writes the same
# JSON the API used to return into /data, and http.js reads it from there.
#
# Kept separate from .env.production so the server build — one Express process serving both the API
# and the app — keeps working unchanged for the day this moves back onto a real host.
VITE_STATIC_DATA=1
